        },
        {
          "text": "Mitabi yawo yanyana buyo, iyoogonkwa, elyo kuyoosika banakazi kuti baitente. Bantu aba tabamvwisyi makani pe. Nkaambo kako sikubalenga takooyoobafwida zyalo, ayooyo iwakababumba takooyoobafwida buuya.",
          "type": "text",
