        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba obo kuyoolizigwa mweembo mupati, elyo abo ibakali kunyonyooka mucisi ca-Asuri, abaabo ibakatandidwe munyika ya-Egepita bayoosika boonse, bayookomba Jehova mucilundu cisalala caku-Jerusalemu.",
